#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/migration.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Migrate from Slack </administration-guide/onboard/migrate-from-"
"slack>` - Learn how to migrate from Slack to Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Slack에서 마이그레이션 </administration-guide/onboard/migrate-from-slack>` - Slack에서 "
"OKR.BEST로 마이그레이션하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/migration.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`Migrate from Gitlab Omnibus </administration-guide/onboard/migrate-"
