#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/migration.rst:27
msgid ""
":doc:`Migration announcement email template </administration-"
"guide/onboard/migration-announcement-email>` - Use this email template to"
" notify your users that you've migrated to Mattermost."
msgstr ""
